N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=common}}'''Penguin''' is a {{C|Common|common}} knife that is obtainable by completing 15 Daily Quests in the "Quests" tab during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
It uses the [[Default Knife|default knife]] mesh, the blade has a white base and has a cartoon penguin with a red beanie with white stripes and a red scarf with red and white stripes, hence the name.

